# Shared fallback material for OBJ meshes exported with `usemtl material_0`.
# Isaac Sim 6 rejects the prior missing-material fallback because it derives an
# invalid negative roughness.  These neutral physical values preserve geometry
# while making the mesh set importable into USD.
newmtl material_0
Ka 0.2 0.2 0.2
Kd 0.7 0.7 0.7
Ks 0.1 0.1 0.1
# Sim 6's OBJ importer consumes the PBR roughness extension directly.
# Do not use the legacy Ns shininess term: its conversion path can create
# the invalid -29 roughness that aborts the USD import.
Pr 0.5
d 1.0
illum 2
